        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1881013b-68de-5d74-b700-56a9f9b4090d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Mafalda of Savoy, Victor Emmanuel III, Elena of Montenegro\n- Organizations: NGI\n- Products: SS Principessa Mafalda\n- Places: Italy, Genoa, Buenos Aires, South America\n\nFacts:\n- Victor Emmanuel III was born on 11 November 1869 and became King of Italy on 29 July 1900.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy was born on 2 November 1902 as the second daughter of King Victor Emmanuel III of Italy and his wife Elena of Montenegro.\n- In 1909, the SS Principessa Mafalda, which was named after Princess Mafalda of Savoy, entered NGI's South American service between Genoa and Buenos Aires.\n- Victor Emmanuel III abdicated as King of Italy on 9 May 1946.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy died on 27 August 1944.\n- Victor Emmanuel III died on 28 December 1947.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
